# GludioCleric's and GludioClericStand's clan-attacked hooks on a draw of 20 or more: both
# Aden clerics (35237, 35250) stay idle, however hurt their clan mate, the knight (35235):
# the second hit's calls read 40 of its 440 hit points.
character Hunter 20
random always 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioCleric
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioClericStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc cleric 35237 SiegeGuard 100 150 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill MAGIC_HEAL 4115 1
npc stand 35250 SiegeGuard 100 -150 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill MAGIC_HEAL 4115 1

hit knight 400
hit knight 10
  desires cleric -
  desires stand -

tick x2
